# Normalize line endings repo-wide: every text file checks out with LF on
# every platform, so the ~86 source-pin tests that regex source text behave
# identically on Linux, macOS, and Windows (issue #88). Binary assets are
# marked explicitly so git never attempts newline conversion on them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binaries (never normalize, never diff).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
